     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"{x^2} = 49\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"x \\pm \\sqrt {49} \"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>Use the Square Root Property.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"x = \\pm 7\"></span></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>Simplify.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-math=\"x = 7\"></span></td>\n<td><span data-math=\"x = - 7\"></span></td>\n<td>Rewrite the two solutions.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>This is the correct option.</p>"
    }
